  "proof": "在Z/(2^64)中((C*H+Y)*W+X)=C*(H*W)+Y*W+X。H/W各32位非负，因此plane64=H*W精确；channel与row仍截到原unsigned64。Y/X保留原signed64坐标及原[63:0]位模式，bounds门控与地址base加法原64回绕不改。",
  "candidate": "仅新增feature_geometry_plane[63:0]/feature_channel_plane_offset[63:0]/feature_row_offset[63:0]组合信号；原feature_scan_in_bounds分支内令plane=zeroext(H)*zeroext(W)，channel=zeroext(C)*plane，row=feature_input_y[63:0]*zeroext(W)，offset=channel+row+feature_input_x[63:0]。源offset/address默认零和所有if/FF不动。",
  "critical_semantics": [
    "feature_input_y/x是signed64，不是S9输出C/Y/X的低32赋值；不允许截坐标或改变零扩展乘积转signed64后的解释。",
    "原coordinate乘加减在64位二补码回绕，bounds仅消费非负且<H/W的值；禁止新增33/65进位守卫。",
    "ST_FEATURE_SCAN先index>=patch_byte_count，再padding，再address>U32，后请求；不得把range提前到未消费扫描/padding。",
